| Family | Count | 역할 |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| A. scalar/vector/geometry/sampling helper | 21 | 작은 순수 함수와 좌표·noise·mask helper |
| B. allocation/configuration/cache/lifecycle | 16 | Grid/RT/NeighborGrid 초기화, cache, parameter hub, bounds, sim step |
| C. point-source transport/adapters | 25 | bone, Chaos, Data Channel, arrays, trackers, HashGrid, world-to-unit |
